{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1463556-switching-tradition","id":1463556,"title":"Switching tradition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-12T01:41:04-07:00","id":1463556,"title":"Switching tradition","content":"Are there any books that cover switching a tradition? I wasn't sure if there was something in the players book in revised or something.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T03:08:26-07:00","id":1463565,"title":"","content":"Revised core has the Probationary Member Flaw, that covers some of this ground I'd say.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T03:18:29-07:00","id":1463566,"title":"","content":"MRev's Initiates of the Art has a Dual Tradition Merit that you can pick up to represent a character who has joined more than one Tradition. M20's Book of Secrets revises that so that it's less about multiple Traditions and more about a dual Focus, which is part of M20's shift away from one's Tradition being the keeper of one's paradigm and practice: in MRev, your Tradition comes first, and your paradigm and practice follow; in M20, your Paradigm and Practice come first, and your Tradition (if any) follows. <br /> <br /> So to be clear: what are you actually interested in: switching your Tradition, or shifting your Focus?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T04:08:29-07:00","id":1463569,"title":"","content":"My mage is a hermatic (house solificati) whose kind of ended up shunned for losing her position as deacon, and her enemy flaw has caused a lot of the people in her house to dislike her. she doesn't have any social flaws that would cause the order to hate against her, but its just what the ST has decided that she's a reject in her own tradition.<br /> <br /> So I was musing whether switching trads to maybe CoE where it's a lot less drama and high exspectations. Plus it fits best with the solificati background.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T04:29:56-07:00","id":1463573,"title":"","content":"As Dataweaver said, in M20 Tradition is much more of a political choice than a magical one. I'd say there's a fairly easy story to get from start to finish there:<br /> <br /> Fall out with the Order of Hermes as a Solificati.<br /> Spend some time with the Children of Knowledge (the Solificati that didn't join the Order).<br /> Learn about a way more experimental and experiential approach to alchemy.<br /> Decide that the Traditions are still the best place for you.<br /> Ask the Cult for membership and impress them with some of the sweet shit the CoK taught you on your break.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T05:44:31-07:00","id":1463580,"title":"","content":"actually she's like almost 60 and was part of the solificati that chose to join the order rather then the CoK. I did consider have her switch to CoK but i feel like that would lead to some order wrath. i don't think the order would mind so much keeping it in the traditions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T14:22:54-07:00","id":1463620,"title":"","content":"Do as you will. In your case it is much more a political thing than anything, unless you want to. Mechanically those are the two possible effects, the already cited Flaw <i>On Probation</i> and Merit <i>Dual Tradition</i>, but those are optional things in the sense that you not necessarily is going to have animosity or change Paradigm by switching Traditions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-12T14:45:18-07:00","id":1463624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jasper mage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1463556-switching-tradition?p=1463580#post1463580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">actually she's like almost 60 and was part of the solificati that chose to join the order rather then the CoK. I did consider have her switch to CoK but i feel like that would lead to some order wrath. i don't think the order would mind so much keeping it in the traditions.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wasn't suggesting switching to the CoK, just learning from them a bit. As disgruntled Hermetic is someone they'd gladly try to recruit even if your PC goes back to the Traditions but a different one.<br /> <br /> And it's not like she's going to be free from Order wrath as it is from the sound of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T04:12:39-07:00","id":1463689,"title":"","content":"no she's probably not. xD sometimes I wonder if it'd be easier to retire her and just start a new one with less drama lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25510-jasper-mage","name":"Jasper mage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T05:40:00-07:00","id":1463697,"title":"","content":"That feels like a talk to your ST thing more than anything else. If the drama your PC is facing isn't fun, ultimately nothing in any book can fix that if the ST is the one making it happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T09:28:21-07:00","id":1463708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jasper mage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1463556-switching-tradition?p=1463689#post1463689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">no she's probably not. xD sometimes I wonder if it'd be easier to retire her and just start a new one with less drama lol</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> on that, it seems you have an issue with hoe the ST is handling the situation. This have nothing to do with the books and may not solve itself just with in-character action.<br /> <br /> One thing is for your personal story in the game lead you to decide your character should change this or that, BECAUSE you're enjoying the drama. If something in the game isn't fun for you, you have to talk with the ST, not try to fix it all by yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}